// ================================================================
// META-CONTROL PLANE ARCHITECTURE v2.1 - RIO Format
// 2035 RETROSPECTIVE: The battlescarred architecture that survived 10 years of optimization wars
// December 2035 Reality: The control plane IS the optimizer; everything else is substrate
// ================================================================

